      "writtenOn": "2019-12-13T02:33:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks, I just added the \"vts-core\" and kept the \"general-tests\" since we need it if you want to set it as a presubmit by using test-mapping.\nCurrently, test-mapping only wrapper the tests in general-tests or device-tests.",
      "parentUuid": "0eea84c3_eb887054",
